{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Logical_Thinking)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Logical Thinking)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The set of all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efaf7382f309efe8361302a7c57315c0e92e4adb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{2004}(\\log_{2003}(\\log_{2002}(\\log_{2001}{x})))\\]\" width=\"257\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>is defined is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/8/0f8cf718eeeda414b47579ea618b460e5a38cf5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{x\\mid x &gt; c\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/2/b421f3f99b7951e75eda6fae877ba772b69a6160.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf {(A) } 0\\qquad \\textbf {(B) }2001^{2002} \\qquad \\textbf {(C) }2002^{2003} \\qquad \\textbf {(D) }2003^{2004} \\qquad \\textbf {(E) }2001^{2002^{2003}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"597\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b28547efd22be1c4a05fa193cd7038fc65d71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/1/2210e1c13767dc4524e3c1415bacd736c6a76317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;1,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"16\" /> note that:\n</p>\n<ol style=\"margin-left: 1.5em;\">\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2aba777fd992fd3f377364f9ee87b24eb98e89b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"45\" height=\"19\" /> is defined if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/7/3470668bb8a39eebcb9ed22863d4c71245731ed9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n  </p><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cfcf23e7e527cec27f683a1adeb3c40096677ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a&gt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" /> if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b8cb101d61e55686abe4187d5a33ba9de1b2943.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;b^c.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" /></li><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p></ol>\n<p>Therefore, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f04993e6f16dda48f411ac332c7a79c9732f07fb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\log_{2004}(\\log_{2003}(\\log_{2002}(\\log_{2001}{x}))) \\text{ is defined} &amp;\\implies \\log_{2003}(\\log_{2002}(\\log_{2001}{x}))&gt;0 \\\\ &amp;\\implies \\log_{2002}(\\log_{2001}{x})&gt;1 \\\\ &amp;\\implies \\log_{2001}{x}&gt;2002 \\\\ &amp;\\implies x&gt;2001^{2002}, \\end{align*}\" width=\"608\" height=\"94\" />\nfrom which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/0/f108ad9ca3fa9531ab71aacfb115e03803d1c694.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) }2001^{2002}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"149\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~Azjps ~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee94d03c2e342ff065d2b84da09ce7e8c99e8180.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x &amp;= 2001^a, \\\\ a &amp;= 2002^b, \\\\ b &amp;= 2003^c, \\\\ c &amp;= 2004^d. \\end{align*}\" width=\"82\" height=\"94\" />\nIt follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a738e63b7eb591f9d89a7e126bd9bbecca05d85.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 2001^{2002^{2003^{2004^d}}}.\\]\" width=\"155\" height=\"25\" />\nThe smallest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/3/ab35f073b9be6e22f899013a7f67984f25f6cc89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d\\rightarrow -\\infty,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> so this expression becomes\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/3/293dc68e4ee23b057f7cf9a5c01ed157b2351d72.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 2001^{2002^{2003^0}} = 2001^{2002^1} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) }2001^{2002}}.\\]\" width=\"359\" height=\"31\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Logical_Thinking.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Logical_Thinking)\">Video Solution (Logical Thinking)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Logical Thinking)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/46c-VN1QzWk\">https://youtu.be/46c-VN1QzWk</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A\">2004 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl